{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不只想靠近，也想被对方同样珍惜，还想有机会好好关心对方，看看两个人能一起过怎样的日子。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时不再因想被珍惜而自责，眼前的亲近和想对对方好的心思让他顾不上自己的得失。\",\n      \"key\": \"顾不上得失\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他觉得自己有许多爱可以给，也很珍惜眼前的亲近，一时觉得想要的生活仿佛就在眼前。对方并没有给他新的保证。\",\n      \"key\": \"没有给他新的保证\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"text\": \"眼前的亲近让他暂时顾不上追问两个人以后会怎样，只想让这阵欢喜多留一会儿。等欢喜稍退，他想知道对方是否也会选择自己的念头又会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"欢喜多留一会儿\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R51\", \"R52\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并并具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留承认渴望后更清楚自己想要什么，将想靠近、被珍惜、关心对方和共同生活说具体，避免重复强调更想靠近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R53\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把愿望暂时不再受缺憾折磨的总结，改成眼前的亲近和关心让他顾不上自己的得失，写出当下为何暂时不再自责。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R54\", \"R55\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩并去重\",\n      \"why\": \"保留有许多爱可以给、珍惜眼前亲近、想要的生活仿佛就在眼前的饱满感，也保留对方没有新保证这一限制。删去仍盼对方选择自己的表述，将这份期待留给S12-4在欢喜稍退后重新浮现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R56\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S12-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"具体化\",\n      \"why\": \"保留暂时顾不上未来、想让欢喜多留一会儿的意思，并说明欢喜稍退后，尚未得到回应的期待又会回来，承接下一段幸福仍有缺口的转折。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc2bb922-de65-426c-b26d-a9d9bdb9f3d7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224641338963Z", "elapsed_seconds": 108.406, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:48:29.763565+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1aa7884c5c26c4be384d922a79b63cbb298e0ed7272d9cde24404c2143809a93", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224641338963Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c092ea61c63fb938d2f940c35e2c79a38042747015c223